<title>USA: South Fayette SD, Pa., $2.5 mln adjusted NIC.</title>
<headline>South Fayette SD, Pa., $2.5 mln adjusted NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South Fayette Township School District, Pa., said Wednesday it recalculated Prudential Securities Inc's winning bid for the District's $2.5 million bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the net interest cost was 4.7251 percent reflecting the co st of insurance, not the 4.6388 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
